OL,3,GNEWSAChurch clock chimes again after
OL,4,Aoutcry over single noise complaint
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement the authority has
OL,7,Fconfirmed that the chimes have been
OL,8,Frestored earlier on Monday but it was
OL,9,Fstill looking at a longer term
OL,10,Fsolution.
